              "value": "In this episode, I talk about how entrepreneurs often create content based on what they think they should say instead of what they actually want to communicate. That disconnect can make marketing feel exhausting and unsustainable.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b29e57f6-bad9-46fe-bee2-25131504afc6",
